1908:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        commutation at its TRGO output (connected to Timer used in this function) each time
1909:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the TI1 of the Interface Timer detect a commutation at its input TI1.
